<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on September 26, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on September 24.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on September 19, raised 902.30 million francs and was priced at 99.552 percent to yield 1.780 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 258 7340</p>
</text>
